      "html": "<main class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 p-4 font-sans text-gray-900\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"registration page layout container\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-md w-full bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"registration card container\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"header section\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"page title\">\n                Criar conta\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-500 mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"page subtitle\">\n                Comece a criar formulários ilimitados\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <form class=\"space-y-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"registration form\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"email input group\">\n                <label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"email label\" for=\"email\">\n                    Email\n                </label>\n                <input class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 p-3 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"email input field\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"seu@email.com\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"password input group\">\n                <label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"password label\" for=\"password\">\n                    Senha\n                </label>\n                <input class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 p-3 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"password input field\" id=\"password\" minlength=\"6\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" required=\"\" type=\"password\"/>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"submit registration button\" type=\"submit\">\n                Criar conta\n            </button>\n        </form>\n        <p class=\"text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"login link text\">\n            Já tem uma conta?\n            <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"login page link\" href=\"/login\">\n                Fazer login\n            </a>\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</main>\n",
      "comments": [],
